stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Processing : files uploaded, 12 months covered
    Processing --> ActionNeeded : missing or invalid files
    ActionNeeded --> Processing : SME re-uploads
    Processing --> UnderReview : low confidence or open flags
    UnderReview --> ActionNeeded : ops requests documents
    UnderReview --> AwaitingConsent : all items resolved
    Processing --> AwaitingConsent : all checks pass
    AwaitingConsent --> SentToBank : SME consents
    SentToBank --> UnderReview : bank requests more info
    SentToBank --> DecisionReceived : bank records decision
    DecisionReceived --> [*]
